        "original_id": "1a9fb356-05eb-54ab-bfe5-155fc134394a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: James Wan, Leigh Whannell, Patrick Wilson, Rose Byrne, Barbara Hershey, Christy Marx\n- Companies: Blumhouse Productions, Hasbro Studios\n- Products: Insidious, Jem and the Holograms\n- Topics: supernatural horror films, low-budget horror films, 1980s animated television series\n\nFacts:\n- James Wan was born on 27 February 1977 and is a Malaysian-Australian film director, screenwriter, and producer.\n- Insidious is a 2010 American-Canadian supernatural horror film directed by James Wan, written by Leigh Whannell, and starring Patrick Wilson, Rose Byrne, and Barbara Hershey.\n- Blumhouse Productions is mostly known for producing low-budget horror films such as Paranormal Activity, Insidious, The Purge, Sinister, The Gift, Split, and Get Out.\n- Jem and the Holograms borrows elements from the 1980s animated television series Jem by Christy Marx and was produced by Hasbro Studios and Blumhouse Productions.",
